WEBVTT

00:06:28.926 --> 00:06:31.595
through tracking
and charting our expenses.

00:06:31.637 --> 00:06:32.888
Here's how.

00:06:32.930 --> 00:06:35.933
Number one, take a look
at your bank statement

00:06:35.933 --> 00:06:37.643
for the last six months

00:06:37.643 --> 00:06:40.104
and categorize the expenses by type

00:06:40.104 --> 00:06:41.564
for a more holistic view.

00:06:41.856 --> 00:06:43.023
For example,

00:06:43.023 --> 00:06:48.237
your spending on shopping
versus transport versus entertainment.

00:06:48.237 --> 00:06:51.907
Number two, when an expensive
pattern emerges,

00:06:51.907 --> 00:06:54.869
see what that pattern says about yourself.

00:06:54.910 --> 00:06:57.371
Be curious and inquisitive.

00:06:57.413 --> 00:07:00.082
At first, it may not be that obvious,